    "detailed_description": "A town mysteriously appears solely on Halloween night. its origin and creator/s are unknown. Those who have witnessed the town relate their experiences and opinions on books and stories told through the people until their death. Over time, tales and legends were passed down from one generation to another. Until its eventual obscurity and becoming relics of the past.<br><br>One day, Wade Severstone stumbled upon these forgotten legends and divulged them to his classmates, daring them to venture into the town and verify the authenticity of its fabled accounts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Town of Illustive</h2>A mystery puzzle game full of hidden legends and lore.<br><br>You play as Jenet, a new transfer student of Falica High who ends up taking the dare and finds herself deep into the town legends. She must solve the legends and unravel the secret this town can offer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A complete remake of the original Town of illustive game.<br></li><li>A Multi-episodic games separated by episode for ease and convenience. With new episodes coming up in the future.<br>          <i>With multiple endings every episode.</i><br></li><li>Expansive world building that bridges to the upcoming game series by MJM Creative works and Ideas.<br></li><li>Unique puzzles and riddles to solve.<br></li><li>Made in RPG Maker MZ.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A town mysteriously appears solely on Halloween night. its origin and creator/s are unknown. Those who have witnessed the town relate their experiences and opinions on books and stories told through the people until their death. Over time, tales and legends were passed down from one generation to another. Until its eventual obscurity and becoming relics of the past.<br><br>One day, Wade Severstone stumbled upon these forgotten legends and divulged them to his classmates, daring them to venture into the town and verify the authenticity of its fabled accounts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Town of Illustive</h2>A mystery puzzle game full of hidden legends and lore.<br><br>You play as Jenet, a new transfer student of Falica High who ends up taking the dare and finds herself deep into the town legends. She must solve the legends and unravel the secret this town can offer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A complete remake of the original Town of illustive game.<br></li><li>A Multi-episodic games separated by episode for ease and convenience. With new episodes coming up in the future.<br>          <i>With multiple endings every episode.</i><br></li><li>Expansive world building that bridges to the upcoming game series by MJM Creative works and Ideas.<br></li><li>Unique puzzles and riddles to solve.<br></li><li>Made in RPG Maker MZ.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A group of students from Falica High School have been dared by their classmate and class president Wade Severstone. Solving the mysteries that spread from generation to generation once and for all.",
